[CENTER]
[SIZE=7][B][COLOR=#27AE60]Leaf[/COLOR][COLOR=#2C3E50]RTP[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#7F8C8D]Free Random Teleport (RTP) Plugin for Paper, Spigot & Fabric[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=3][B][COLOR=#7F8C8D]Deterministic, bounded-latency random teleport (/rtp or /wild) engine[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[I]The fastest free random teleport plugin for Paper, Spigot, and Bukkit-family servers - instant /rtp and safe random-spawn landings, with no lag spikes under load.[/I]

[I]Supported: Paper, Spigot, Fabric, Arclight / Mohist - Minecraft 1.20.x / 1.21.x / 26.x. Send your players to a safe, random spot, engineered to maintain 20.0 TPS without lag spikes.[/I]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#27AE60][B]100% Free.[/B][/COLOR] Same engine as the paid [URL='https://builtbybit.com/resources/rtp-pro.105418'][B]LeafRTP-Pro[/B][/URL] build. No paywalled [I]/rtp[/I] or nag screens, and no ads - just anonymous [URL='https://bstats.org/']bStats[/URL] usage stats (server-admin opt-out via [I]plugins/bStats/config.yml[/I]).[/SIZE]

[/CENTER]
[CENTER][COLOR=#A0A0A0]------------------------------------------------------------[/COLOR][/CENTER]

[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#27AE60]Why operators pick LeafRTP[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[CENTER][SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#27AE60]19.8 TP/s sustained at 4 ms worst-case tick. Next-best plugin: 70 ms.[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[B]If [I]/rtp[/I] is the top entry in your timings report, this is the fix.[/B] LeafRTP is the fastest free Random Teleport plugin for Bukkit-native Minecraft servers (Paper, Bukkit, Arclight, Mohist, and other Bukkit-family forks), with Fabric supported as a first-class platform:

[LIST]
[*][B]No lag spikes when players spam [I]/rtp[/I].[/B] Worst-case main-thread tick stays at 4 ms (vs. 70-771 ms for the next plugins) - your TPS holds at 20.00 during a teleport burst.
[*][B]Instant teleports, no "Finding a safe location..." wait.[/B] Pre-verified location queue serves [I]/rtp[/I] in one tick instead of loading chunks on demand.
[*][B]Works on plain Bukkit servers at Paper-class speed.[/B] Off-tick [I].mca[/I] Anvil pre-filter, worst tick stays at 3 ms while competitors spike past 3 seconds.
[*][B]Eight claim-plugin integrations bundled[/B] (GriefDefender, GriefPrevention, Lands, WorldGuard, Towny, Factions, HuskTowns, RedProtect) - no add-ons to install.
[*][B]Audited safety[/B]: no unsafe blocks, no force-loaded chunks, no claim-bypassing teleports, no silent failures (REQ-RTP-S-001..S-007).
[/LIST]

On [B]Paper 1.21[/B], measured on the in-repo benchmark harness, two clients spamming [I]/rtp[/I] back-to-back:

