[I]Methodology: Paper 1.21, 2 OPed clients spamming [I]/rtp[/I] continuously, in-repo harness linked below. Spigot and Folia results in the full benchmark section.[/I]

Same throughput as the next-best plugin, [B]~17x lower worst-case tick spike, 35% less CPU per teleport.[/B] On Spigot, LeafRTP's worst tick stays at 3 ms while competitors spike past 3 seconds. Reproduce on your own rig: [URL=https://github.com/dailystruggle/RTP/tree/V3/helpers/StressTestRTP][I]helpers/StressTestRTP/[/I][/URL].

