[*][B]Requirements traced to tests[/B] - every REQ-*, including the seven S-001…S-007 safety prohibitions (no unsafe-block landings, no force-loaded chunks, no claim-bypassing teleports, no main-thread chunk loading, no silently swallowed failures), has an implementing class and regression test: [URL='https://github.com/dailystruggle/RTP/blob/V3/docs/dev/TRACEABILITY.md'][B]TRACEABILITY.md[/B][/URL]
